{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Horny Academy</strong> \u2014 the only school you\u2019ll never want to skip.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088990/extras/a97e59f2ca0ba9dea92947bbd816aa15.avif?t=1763383022\" width=1436 height=794 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a new student, you arrive at the mysterious Academy, invited with no explanation. Within its walls lies a world of magic, desire, and secrets waiting to be uncovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet Academy's students, each carrying their own mysteries. Explore every hidden corner of the school, unlocking not only its secrets but the hidden powers within yourself. Choose carefully who gets close to your heart\u2026 or your desires.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088990/extras/9d33629993466b251b367533491a7d86.avif?t=1763383022\" width=1436 height=718 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember: no invitation to Horny Academy is a coincidence. The Academy has its own plans, and every choice you make brings you closer to discovering why you were chosen\u2026 before it changes you forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088990/extras/34436207ba64b88649a3ca2bb1fa915f.avif?t=1763383022\" width=1436 height=656 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 Branching Storyline \u2014 Your choices truly matter. Flirt, seduce, befriend, betray, or dominate. Every decision changes the story and your relationships.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc69\u200d\ud83c\udf93 Romance and Relationships \u2014 Build connections with a diverse cast of characters. Unlock intimate scenes as your bonds grow deeper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 Mini-Games &amp; Activities \u2014 Attend magical classes, complete playful challenges, and engage in spicy interactions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfeb Explore the Academy \u2014 Discover secret rooms, mysterious teachers, and unexpected encounters as you roam the campus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd75\ufe0f Secrets and mysteries \u2014 the Academy hides more than just pleasures. Discover dark plans, hidden motives, and decide if you\u2019re ready to claim your power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 Multiple endings \u2014 Each choice, alliance, and action changes your fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa7 Immersive Atmosphere \u2014 A sensual and magical world brought to life with beautiful art, music, and erotic storytelling</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088990/extras/e959f316e75adaa345307b6de38a215e.poster.avif?t=1763383022\" width=1170 height=650 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088990/extras/e959f316e75adaa345307b6de38a215e.webm?t=1763383022\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088990/extras/e959f316e75adaa345307b6de38a215e.mp4?t=1763383022\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2764\ufe0f Magic flows through every corner here, and anything around you may hold a hidden pleasure.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4088990?t=1763383022","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4088990?t=1763383022","capsule_image":"h